{% doc %}
  Bundle builder (TE-12, Figma 1:636; index-1280.md khối 9, index-mobile-b.md §1, §1.1).
  Eyebrow, h2 heading, optional link, a fieldset of up to 9 selectable product
  cards from one collection and the Your Bundle panel.
  Layout: 360 grid 2 columns, panel below (gap 32, 1 column); 768 grid 3 columns,
  panel below split in 2 columns; from 64rem grid 7 page columns + panel 5 page
  columns (1280: card 222, panel 503; 1920: panel 576). Below 80rem the panel
  lists every line, no inner scroll.

  Works without JavaScript: a POST form (id bundle-form-<id>) to
  routes.cart_add_url whose checked checkboxes (name id[]) are the variants to add.
  Liquid prints count, lines, subtotal, discount, progress and total for the
  preselected cards, so the panel never jumps when the module loads (CLS 0).
  With 0 items CSS dims both submit buttons and drops pointer events; the module
  sets the real disabled attribute.

  Discounts are display only (AC2, R8): the real price comes from an automatic
  discount the merchant creates. Liquid mirrors the module math (highest tier
  whose quantity is reached, discount = round(subtotal × percent / 100)) and
  outputs data-tiers ("2:10,3:15") with the tiers whose percent is above 0. Every
  tier percent defaults to 0 (ADR 0011 mục 3, ES1-T406): a fresh install shows
  no discount row, no progress bar, no progress text, and the total equals the
  subtotal (TE-12 AC1). There is no discount note (sổ 07/11).

  Sold out (product or variant unavailable, AC4): the input is disabled, the
  item has data-sold-out, there is no selection ring, the image is at 0.6 and the
  card keeps its Sold out badge. The title link always goes to the product page.

  Sticky bar below 48rem (TE-12 AC6, HB1; index-mobile-b.md §1.1): an aside
  printed after the form with the hidden attribute. Without JS it never shows.
  From 48rem it is display none. Its button submits the panel form through the
  form attribute.

  Hooks for assets/bundle-form.js (BE TE-12-R2-BE1; custom element bundle-form
  is the root, imported near the viewport by assets/lazy-module.js). Rename only
  with a ticket comment.
  - Root: data-lazy-module, data-tiers, data-cart-add-url, data-cart-url, data-cart-type,
    data-currency, data-locale, data-label-count-one, data-label-count-other,
    data-label-progress-one (%n is 1, %p), data-label-progress (%n, %p),
    data-label-progress-done (%p),
    data-label-discount (%p), data-label-status (%n, %t), data-label-error.
    JS sets data-enhanced on the root once the panel is rendered.
  - Item input: data-bundle-item, data-title, data-price (cents), value is the
    variant id.
  - Panel: data-bundle-live (content printed by Liquid, kept for the module),
    data-bundle-count, data-bundle-lines (Liquid prints the preselected lines;
    the module replaces the children), data-bundle-line-template
    (data-bundle-line-title, data-bundle-line-price), data-bundle-empty,
    data-bundle-subtotal, data-bundle-discount-row, data-bundle-discount-label,
    data-bundle-discount (amount without a sign, CSS adds the minus),
    data-bundle-total, data-bundle-progress (sets --bundle-progress),
    data-bundle-progress-text (data-done when the highest tier is reached: tick
    icon instead of the lock), data-bundle-submit, data-bundle-status (role
    status), data-bundle-error (role alert).
  - Sticky bar: data-bundle-bar (aside, hidden; the module removes hidden and
    sets html[data-bottom-bar="bundle"] while the grid is in view and the panel
    top is below the bar; keeps it while focus is inside), data-bundle-bar-count,
    data-bundle-bar-total, data-bundle-bar-submit (type submit, form attribute),
    data-bundle-bar-error (role alert; the module writes the error into exactly
    one of data-bundle-bar-error or data-bundle-error). The module measures the
    bar and sets --bundle-bar-height on :root (toast, Big Offer teaser and Inbox
    follow --bottom-bar-height, which reads it). Busy: aria-busy on both buttons.

  Test hooks: bundle-builder, bundle-builder-eyebrow, bundle-builder-heading,
  bundle-builder-link, bundle-builder-list, bundle-builder-item,
  bundle-builder-input, bundle-builder-panel, bundle-builder-count,
  bundle-builder-lines, bundle-builder-line, bundle-builder-empty,
  bundle-builder-subtotal, bundle-builder-discount-row, bundle-builder-discount,
  bundle-builder-total, bundle-builder-progress, bundle-builder-progress-text,
  bundle-builder-submit, bundle-builder-status, bundle-builder-error,
  bundle-builder-placeholder, bundle-sticky-bar, bundle-sticky-bar-count,
  bundle-sticky-bar-total, bundle-sticky-bar-add, bundle-sticky-bar-error.

  Source: the collection setting only, empty on a fresh install (ADR 0011 mục 2:
  templates pass no collection). Empty state: no source or no products → a hint
  in the theme editor, nothing on the storefront.

  Self-contained: callers must leave the body empty.

  @param {string} [id] - Static block id, so this block keeps its own settings. Also used for the heading, form and input ids. Default: block.id
  @param {string} [preselect] - Card positions checked on load, such as ',1,2,3,'. Empty: none

  @example
  {% block 'container', id: 'home-bundle-builder', tag: 'div', background: 'cream' %}
    {% block 'bundle-builder', id: 'bundle-builder' %}{% endblock %}
  {% endblock %}
{% enddoc %}

{%- liquid
  assign source = block.settings.collection

  assign has_products = false
  if source != blank and source.products_count > 0
    assign has_products = true
  endif

  # Tiers above 0%, same order and dedupe as the module (per quantity the highest percent wins)
  assign tiers = ''
  assign tier_max = 0
  for i in (1..3)
    assign quantity_key = 'tier_' | append: i | append: '_quantity'
    assign percent_key = 'tier_' | append: i | append: '_percent'
    assign tier_quantity = block.settings[quantity_key]
    assign tier_percent = block.settings[percent_key]
    if tier_percent > 0
      assign tiers = tiers | append: tier_quantity | append: ':' | append: tier_percent | append: ','
      if tier_quantity > tier_max
        assign tier_max = tier_quantity
      endif
    endif
  endfor
  # split drops the trailing empty value, so the last comma goes away
  assign tiers = tiers | split: ',' | join: ','

  assign eyebrow = block.settings.eyebrow
  assign heading = block.settings.heading
  assign link_label = block.settings.link_label
  assign link_url = block.settings.link_url | default: routes.all_products_collection_url
  assign block_key = id | default: block.id
  assign heading_id = block_key | append: '-heading'
  assign panel_title_id = block_key | append: '-panel-title'
  assign form_id = 'bundle-form-' | append: block_key
  assign cart_type = settings.cart_type | default: 'drawer'
  assign image_sizes = '(min-width: 80rem) 270px, (min-width: 64rem) 20vw, (min-width: 48rem) 33vw, 50vw'

  assign label_count_one = 'blocks.bundle_builder.count_one' | t
  assign label_count_other = 'blocks.bundle_builder.count_other' | t
  assign label_progress_one = 'blocks.bundle_builder.progress_one' | t
  assign label_progress = 'blocks.bundle_builder.progress' | t
  assign label_progress_done = 'blocks.bundle_builder.progress_done' | t
  assign label_discount = 'blocks.bundle_builder.discount' | t
  assign label_status = 'blocks.bundle_builder.status' | t
  assign label_error = 'blocks.bundle_builder.error' | t
  assign label_submit = 'blocks.bundle_builder.submit' | t
  assign label_total = 'blocks.bundle_builder.total' | t
-%}

{%- if has_products -%}
  {%- liquid
    # Cards first: the panel and the bar print the preselected state (no JS, no layout shift)
    assign picked_count = 0
    assign picked_subtotal = 0
    assign picked_lines = ''
  -%}
  {%- capture cards -%}
    {%- for item in source.products limit: 9 -%}
      {%- liquid
        # A multi-source collection can hold variants: they have a parent product
        assign card_product = item
        assign card_variant = item.selected_or_first_available_variant
        if item.product != blank
          assign card_product = item.product
          assign card_variant = item
        endif
        assign card_variant = card_variant | default: card_product.variants.first

        assign sold_out = false
        if card_product.available == false or card_variant.available == false
          assign sold_out = true
        endif

        assign picked = false
        unless sold_out
          assign preselect_key = ',' | append: forloop.index | append: ','
          if preselect contains preselect_key
            assign picked = true
          endif
        endunless

        assign item_title = card_product.title | escape
        assign input_id = block_key | append: '-item-' | append: card_variant.id
      -%}
      {%- if picked -%}
        {%- liquid
          assign picked_count = picked_count | plus: 1
          assign picked_subtotal = picked_subtotal | plus: card_variant.price
        -%}
        {%- capture picked_line -%}
          <li class="bundle-builder__line" data-testid="bundle-builder-line">
            <span class="bundle-builder__line-title">{{ item_title }}</span>
            <span class="bundle-builder__line-price">{{ card_variant.price | money }}</span>
          </li>
        {%- endcapture -%}
        {%- assign picked_lines = picked_lines | append: picked_line -%}
      {%- endif -%}
      <li
        class="bundle-builder__item"
        {% if sold_out %}
          data-sold-out
        {% endif %}
        data-testid="bundle-builder-item"
      >
        {% render 'product-card',
          product: card_product,
          variant: card_variant,
          sizes: image_sizes,
          show_swatches: false,
          show_variant_title: false,
          heading_level: 'h3'
        %}
        <input
          class="bundle-builder__input"
          type="checkbox"
          id="{{ input_id }}"
          name="id[]"
          value="{{ card_variant.id }}"
          data-bundle-item
          data-title="{{ item_title }}"
          data-price="{{ card_variant.price }}"
          data-testid="bundle-builder-input"
          {% if sold_out %}
            disabled
          {% elsif picked %}
            checked
          {% endif %}
        >
        <label class="bundle-builder__select" for="{{ input_id }}">
          <span class="visually-hidden">
            {%- if sold_out -%}
              {{- 'blocks.bundle_builder.item_sold_out' | t: title: item_title -}}
            {%- else -%}
              {{- 'blocks.bundle_builder.item_select' | t: title: item_title -}}
            {%- endif -%}
          </span>
        </label>
      </li>
    {%- endfor -%}
  {%- endcapture -%}

  {%- liquid
    # Same math as assets/bundle-form.js update(): reached tier, next tier, progress
    assign reached_quantity = 0
    assign reached_percent = 0
    assign next_quantity = 0
    assign next_percent = 0
    for i in (1..3)
      assign quantity_key = 'tier_' | append: i | append: '_quantity'
      assign percent_key = 'tier_' | append: i | append: '_percent'
      assign tier_quantity = block.settings[quantity_key]
      assign tier_percent = block.settings[percent_key]
      if tier_percent > 0
        if tier_quantity <= picked_count
          if tier_quantity > reached_quantity
            assign reached_quantity = tier_quantity
            assign reached_percent = tier_percent
          elsif tier_quantity == reached_quantity and tier_percent > reached_percent
            assign reached_percent = tier_percent
          endif
        elsif next_quantity == 0 or tier_quantity < next_quantity
          assign next_quantity = tier_quantity
          assign next_percent = tier_percent
        elsif tier_quantity == next_quantity and tier_percent > next_percent
          assign next_percent = tier_percent
        endif
      endif
    endfor

    assign picked_discount = picked_subtotal | times: reached_percent | divided_by: 100.0 | round
    assign picked_total = picked_subtotal | minus: picked_discount

    if picked_count == 1
      assign count_text = label_count_one | replace: '%n', picked_count
    else
      assign count_text = label_count_other | replace: '%n', picked_count
    endif

    assign discount_text = label_discount | replace: '%p', reached_percent

    assign progress = 0
    assign progress_text = ''
    if tier_max > 0
      assign progress = picked_count | times: 100.0 | divided_by: tier_max
      if progress > 100
        assign progress = 100
      endif
      if next_quantity > 0
        assign items_left = next_quantity | minus: picked_count
        if items_left == 1
          assign progress_text = label_progress_one
        else
          assign progress_text = label_progress
        endif
        assign progress_text = progress_text | replace: '%n', items_left | replace: '%p', next_percent
      else
        assign progress_text = label_progress_done | replace: '%p', reached_percent
      endif
    endif
  -%}

  <bundle-form
    class="bundle-builder"
    {% if tiers != blank %}
      data-tiers="{{ tiers }}"
    {% endif %}
    data-cart-add-url="{{ routes.cart_add_url }}"
    data-cart-url="{{ routes.cart_url }}"
    data-cart-type="{{ cart_type | escape }}"
    data-currency="{{ cart.currency.iso_code }}"
    data-locale="{{ request.locale.iso_code }}"
    data-label-count-one="{{ label_count_one | escape }}"
    data-label-count-other="{{ label_count_other | escape }}"
    data-label-progress-one="{{ label_progress_one | escape }}"
    data-label-progress="{{ label_progress | escape }}"
    data-label-progress-done="{{ label_progress_done | escape }}"
    data-label-discount="{{ label_discount | escape }}"
    data-label-status="{{ label_status | escape }}"
    data-label-error="{{ label_error | escape }}"
    data-lazy-module="{{ 'bundle-form.js' | asset_url }}"
    data-testid="bundle-builder"
    {{ block.shopify_attributes }}
  >
    {%- if eyebrow != blank or heading != blank or link_label != blank -%}
      <div class="bundle-builder__header">
        {%- if eyebrow != blank or heading != blank -%}
          <div class="bundle-builder__titles">
            {%- if eyebrow != blank -%}
              <p class="bundle-builder__eyebrow" data-testid="bundle-builder-eyebrow">{{ eyebrow | escape }}</p>
            {%- endif -%}
            {%- if heading != blank -%}
              <h2 class="bundle-builder__heading" id="{{ heading_id }}" data-testid="bundle-builder-heading">
                {{- heading -}}
              </h2>
            {%- endif -%}
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if link_label != blank -%}
          <a class="bundle-builder__link" href="{{ link_url }}" data-testid="bundle-builder-link">
            {{- link_label | escape -}}
          </a>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}

    <form
      class="bundle-builder__form"
      id="{{ form_id }}"
      method="post"
      action="{{ routes.cart_add_url }}"
      autocomplete="off"
      {% if heading != blank %}
        aria-labelledby="{{ heading_id }}"
      {% endif %}
    >
      <fieldset class="bundle-builder__fieldset">
        <legend class="visually-hidden">{{ 'blocks.bundle_builder.legend' | t }}</legend>
        <ul class="bundle-builder__list" role="list" data-testid="bundle-builder-list">
          {{- cards -}}
        </ul>
      </fieldset>

      <div
        class="bundle-builder__panel"
        role="group"
        aria-labelledby="{{ panel_title_id }}"
        data-testid="bundle-builder-panel"
      >
        {%- comment -%} display: contents except 48–64rem, where the panel splits into 2 columns {%- endcomment -%}
        <div class="bundle-builder__panel-main">
          <div class="bundle-builder__panel-header">
            <h3 class="bundle-builder__panel-title" id="{{ panel_title_id }}">
              {{- 'blocks.bundle_builder.panel_title' | t -}}
            </h3>
            <span
              class="bundle-builder__count"
              data-bundle-live
              data-bundle-count
              data-testid="bundle-builder-count"
            >
              {{- count_text -}}
            </span>
          </div>

          <div class="bundle-builder__selection" data-bundle-live>
            <ul class="bundle-builder__lines" role="list" data-bundle-lines data-testid="bundle-builder-lines">
              {{- picked_lines -}}
            </ul>
            <template data-bundle-line-template>
              <li class="bundle-builder__line" data-testid="bundle-builder-line">
                <span class="bundle-builder__line-title" data-bundle-line-title></span>
                <span class="bundle-builder__line-price" data-bundle-line-price></span>
              </li>
            </template>
            <p
              class="bundle-builder__empty"
              data-bundle-empty
              data-testid="bundle-builder-empty"
              {% if picked_count > 0 %}
                hidden
              {% endif %}
            >
              {{- 'blocks.bundle_builder.empty' | t -}}
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bundle-builder__panel-side">
          <div class="bundle-builder__summary">
            <div class="bundle-builder__row" data-bundle-live>
              <span>{{ 'blocks.bundle_builder.subtotal' | t }}</span>
              <span data-bundle-subtotal data-testid="bundle-builder-subtotal">
                {{- picked_subtotal | money -}}
              </span>
            </div>

            {%- if tiers != blank -%}
              <div
                class="bundle-builder__row bundle-builder__row--discount"
                data-bundle-live
                data-bundle-discount-row
                data-testid="bundle-builder-discount-row"
                {% if reached_percent == 0 %}
                  hidden
                {% endif %}
              >
                <span class="bundle-builder__discount-label">
                  {%- render 'status-icon', name: 'tag' -%}
                  <span data-bundle-discount-label>{{ discount_text }}</span>
                </span>
                <span
                  class="bundle-builder__discount"
                  data-bundle-discount
                  data-testid="bundle-builder-discount"
                >
                  {{- picked_discount | money -}}
                </span>
              </div>

              <div class="bundle-builder__tier" data-bundle-live>
                <div
                  class="bundle-builder__progress"
                  style="--bundle-progress: {{ progress }}%;"
                  aria-hidden="true"
                  data-bundle-progress
                  data-testid="bundle-builder-progress"
                ></div>
                <div
                  class="bundle-builder__progress-text"
                  data-bundle-progress-text
                  data-testid="bundle-builder-progress-text"
                  {% if next_quantity == 0 %}
                    data-done
                  {% endif %}
                >
                  {{- progress_text -}}
                </div>
              </div>
            {%- endif -%}

            <div class="bundle-builder__row bundle-builder__row--total" data-bundle-live>
              <span>{{ label_total }}</span>
              <span class="bundle-builder__total" data-bundle-total data-testid="bundle-builder-total">
                {{- picked_total | money -}}
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="bundle-builder__actions">
            <button
              class="button bundle-builder__submit"
              type="submit"
              data-bundle-submit
              data-testid="bundle-builder-submit"
            >
              {{- label_submit -}}
              {%- render 'slideshow-icon', name: 'arrow' -%}
            </button>
            <div class="visually-hidden" role="status" data-bundle-status data-testid="bundle-builder-status"></div>
            <div class="bundle-builder__error" role="alert" data-bundle-error data-testid="bundle-builder-error"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </form>

    <aside
      class="bundle-bar"
      aria-label="{{ 'blocks.bundle_builder.bar_label' | t }}"
      data-bundle-bar
      data-testid="bundle-sticky-bar"
      hidden
    >
      <div class="bundle-bar__alert">
        {%- render 'status-icon', name: 'warning' -%}
        <p
          class="bundle-bar__alert-text"
          role="alert"
          data-bundle-bar-error
          data-testid="bundle-sticky-bar-error"
        ></p>
      </div>
      <div class="bundle-bar__row">
        <p class="bundle-bar__summary">
          <span class="bundle-bar__count" data-bundle-bar-count data-testid="bundle-sticky-bar-count">
            {{- count_text -}}
          </span>
          <span class="bundle-bar__total">
            <span class="visually-hidden">{{ label_total }} </span>
            <span data-bundle-bar-total data-testid="bundle-sticky-bar-total">{{ picked_total | money }}</span>
          </span>
        </p>
        <button
          class="button bundle-bar__add"
          type="submit"
          form="{{ form_id }}"
          data-bundle-bar-submit
          data-testid="bundle-sticky-bar-add"
        >
          {{- label_submit -}}
        </button>
      </div>
    </aside>

    <script src="{{ 'lazy-module.js' | asset_url }}" type="module"></script>
  </bundle-form>
{%- elsif request.design_mode -%}
  <div class="bundle-builder__placeholder" data-testid="bundle-builder-placeholder" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
    {{ 'blocks.bundle_builder.placeholder' | t }}
  </div>
{%- endif -%}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "t:general.bundle_builder",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "eyebrow",
      "label": "t:labels.eyebrow",
      "default": "Build your bundle"
    },
    {
      "type": "inline_richtext",
      "id": "heading",
      "label": "t:labels.heading",
      "default": "Pick Your Kit, Save As You Go"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "link_label",
      "label": "t:labels.link_label",
      "info": "t:info.bundle_builder_link",
      "default": "View Preset Bundles"
    },
    {
      "type": "url",
      "id": "link_url",
      "label": "t:labels.link_url"
    },
    {
      "type": "collection",
      "id": "collection",
      "label": "t:labels.collection",
      "info": "t:info.bundle_builder_collection"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "t:general.bundle_builder_tiers",
      "info": "t:info.bundle_builder_tiers"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "tier_1_quantity",
      "min": 2,
      "max": 9,
      "step": 1,
      "label": "t:labels.tier_1_quantity",
      "default": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "tier_1_percent",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 50,
      "step": 1,
      "unit": "t:labels.unit_percent",
      "label": "t:labels.tier_1_percent",
      "default": 0
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "tier_2_quantity",
      "min": 2,
      "max": 9,
      "step": 1,
      "label": "t:labels.tier_2_quantity",
      "default": 3
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "tier_2_percent",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 50,
      "step": 1,
      "unit": "t:labels.unit_percent",
      "label": "t:labels.tier_2_percent",
      "default": 0
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "tier_3_quantity",
      "min": 2,
      "max": 9,
      "step": 1,
      "label": "t:labels.tier_3_quantity",
      "default": 5
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "tier_3_percent",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 50,
      "step": 1,
      "unit": "t:labels.unit_percent",
      "label": "t:labels.tier_3_percent",
      "default": 0
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}

